              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Stainless Steel Grade Custom 455 | UNS# S45500 is an advanced martensitic alloy included in the precipitation hardening stainless steels. Combining corrosion resistance, hardenability, ease of fabrication, and yield strength that is 3 times the strength of grade 304. Custom 455 is known for being soft and formable in the annealed condition, but single-step aging treatments result in an exceptionally high yield strength that also demonstrates good ductility and toughness. Applications generally include heat exchangers, conveyors, food processing and similar industries."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Stainless Steel Grade Custom 455 Specifications:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[AMS 5617](https://titanium.com/ams-5617-specification/)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[ASTM A564](https://titanium.com/astm-a564-specification/) , [ASTM F899](https://titanium.com/astm-f899-specification/)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Stainless Steel Grade Custom 455 product forms offered at all Titanium Industries’ locations:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Stainless Steel Grade Custom 455 Round Bar](https://titanium.com/shop/products/mill-products-stainless-steel-round-bar)"
                }
